*.mp4
*.mkv
*.mov
*.avi
*.ogg
*.mp3
!tests/fixtures/synthetic_en.wav

**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Quarto / LaTeX build intermediates
*_files/
/_book/docs/
/Parole-Functional-Ecosystem.tex
/index.log

